before:
yield pauses the generator after producing a value.
```javascript
function* colors() {
  yield "teal";
  yield "gold";
}
const it = colors();
console.log(it.next());
```
The first result has value teal and done false.

after:
`yield` produces one value and pauses the generator.
```javascript
function* colors() {
  yield "teal";
  yield "gold";
}
const it = colors();
console.log(it.next());
```
The first result has `value: "teal"` and `done: false`. The body pauses before reaching gold.
